=== THE FIX ===
setStatusOnce() -- the status is written only while it is still Ok, so FIRST FAILURE WINS.
Every status write in the header is routed through it. NO THRESHOLD CHANGED and no test
expectation was relaxed: the test asserted the correct semantics and the code was wrong.
